  "description": "Unofficial fork of zxing-cpp 3.1.1 / ZXingCpp 0.5.3: adds linear barcode detection at arbitrary rotation angles (plus/minus 45 degrees) with sub-pixel scan line sampling. Managed layer now ships the enhanced helpers used in the demo: BarcodeScanner, ScanResult, BarcodeInfo, and Barcode.Rotation/Orientation/LineCount/Points, plus ImageView(IntPtr). Target framework net8.0-windows. Use this package INSTEAD of ZXingCpp, not together with it.",
